Every operation runs niimath (Chris Rorden, BSD-2-Clause) compiled to
WebAssembly by @niivue/niimath 1.3.2, the build the NiiMath web app pins. The
command line loads its BSD-2-Clause build (niimath.js, niimath.wasm), not the
GPL-2 build the package also ships; see app/node_modules/@niivue/niimath/LICENSE
in a portable archive.
